              311.3990478515625,
              272.3953857421875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "determine the amount of cyclic control authority that is ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRoman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              71.99999237060547,
              274.8953857421875,
              311.6318359375,
              284.8953857421875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "available, and establish both the longitudinal and lateral CG ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRoman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              71.99999237060547,
              287.3953857421875,
              311.49798583984375,
              297.3953857421875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "envelopes that allow the pilot to load the helicopter so there ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRoman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
